{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107120","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710712001:1":{"text":"What can I help with this time?","source_cn":"嗯……还有什么我能帮忙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7E7EACBBB0A0238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710712002:1":{"text":"Forgive me. This is the final step.","source_cn":"抱歉，老师。这是最后一步了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656E52477AF6A398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710712003:1":{"text":"Please enter Peggy's dream and deliver the <style=\"highlight\">true Excalibur</style> to her, and bring back the fake one in exchange.","source_cn":"我希望您能潜入佩吉的梦境，将这把<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AAC0058CF5FBF5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710712004:1":{"text":"A dream delivery? Simple enough. In dreams, distance is an illusion.","source_cn":"带入梦境吗？这倒是不难。在梦的法则里，物体没有重量，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C34BEA9FDFC5D13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710712005:1":{"text":"I can project the sword's existence into the dream and materialize it...","source_cn":"我可以把这把剑的“存在”投影于梦中，再将其具现化……把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEF65116A5D70333","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710712006:1":{"text":"As long as she falls asleep and lets me in.","source_cn":"只要她进入梦乡，向我敞开意识的门户，就可以……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE39A874453D38D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710712007:1":{"text":"I'm counting on you.","source_cn":"正是如此。拜托您了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F42BABB2DE5C37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710712008:1":{"text":"You quickly activate the communicator. Cassadee's voice answers.","source_cn":"事不宜迟，你立刻启动了通讯器，光芒闪烁后，科丝蒂的声音...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A300FA79D36FDB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You quickly activate the communicator. Cassadee's voice answers.","female":"You quickly activate the communicator. Cassadee's voice answers.","variant_male_record_index":"226391","variant_female_record_index":"226392","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"Magic Communicator","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710712009:0":{"text":"Magister Merlin?","source_cn":"梅林大人？是您吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA897C170689AAF76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister Merlin?","female":"Magister Merlin?","variant_male_record_index":"226393","variant_female_record_index":"226394","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1710712009":{"text":"Magister Merlin?","source_cn":"梅林大人？是您吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA897C170689AAF76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister Merlin?","female":"Magister Merlin?","variant_male_record_index":"226393","variant_female_record_index":"226394","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710712010:0":{"text":"Mother! Is it really you?!","source_cn":"母后？母后！您在吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE3C3757F32DFF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710712011:0":{"text":"It is, my darling.","source_cn":"佩吉，我在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46606A53E481E38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710712012:0":{"text":"*Sob* Mother, I'm so sorry! I've been so foolish!","source_cn":"哇呜——母后，我好想你！都怪我……让你们那么担心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A90C152E6A6FA00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710712013:0":{"text":"Hush, now. None of this is your fault.","source_cn":"佩吉，好孩子，听我说。这不是你的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1F2DBDD5C64AA6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710712014:0":{"text":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","source_cn":"王后用温和的语气向佩吉道来始末，只是奥利安的身世对佩吉...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3BEEDC7623F9C719","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","female":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","variant_male_record_index":"226399","variant_female_record_index":"226400","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1710712014":{"text":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","source_cn":"王后用温和的语气向佩吉道来始末，只是奥利安的身世对佩吉太过于沉重，她与你们对视一番，默契地没有对佩吉提起此事。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3BEEDC7623F9C719","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","female":"The Queen gently explains the situation to Peggy, omitting the heavy truth of Orion's parentage for now.","variant_male_record_index":"226399","variant_female_record_index":"226400","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710712015:0":{"text":"He's lost his way!","source_cn":"……嗯，没错！奥利安算是被某些力量迷惑了心智，误入歧途了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E03F8EE0F143BA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710712016:0":{"text":"That's right. What matters now is stopping this, Peggy.","source_cn":"是这样的，佩吉。现在不是追究原因的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DBEDD9A678D2FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1710712017:0":{"text":"And we need your help, yours and Cassadee's.","source_cn":"为了阻止他继续犯错，我们需要你和科丝蒂的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83E25F15983C2A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1710712018:0":{"text":"We must exchange the real and fake swords.","source_cn":"我们必须得交换真假石中剑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17E6D31A39580A60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1710712019:0":{"text":"Of course, Your Majesty. But... how?","source_cn":"当然，陛下。但交换……？我们应该怎么做？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE447B394609363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1710712020:0":{"text":"Please help Peggy fall asleep quickly.","source_cn":"科丝蒂，请协助佩吉快速入眠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB2F331FE1DCB1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1710712021:1":{"text":"Peggy, Aurora will find you in your dream and bring the true Excalibur.","source_cn":"佩吉，稍后，奥萝菈老师会在梦境中找到你，将真正的石中剑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F8D5247ED605AFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1710712022:0":{"text":"After receiving it, sleep again while holding the fake sword and Aurora will retrieve it.","source_cn":"你们拿到真剑后，再带着伪剑入睡，奥萝菈老师会把它带回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA1986FF2DC4078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1710712023:0":{"text":"Understood. Don't worry, Cassadee will protect me. And I've grown stronger too!","source_cn":"我记住了，母后。您别担心。科丝蒂会保护我，而且……我也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA227618368A9B1EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1710712024:1":{"text":"After ending the call, Peggy prepares for sleep.","source_cn":"佩吉挂断了通讯器，准备进入睡眠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32D23A2073240200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1710712025:1":{"text":"Your turn, Aurora!","source_cn":"喂！奥萝菈！该你上场了。","status":"matched","h